WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.013
- All right!

00:00:01.013 --> 00:00:03.030
Now, it's time to bring a
little extra joys to your day.

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.338
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:05.906
(upbeat music)

00:00:05.906 --> 00:00:07.680
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.140
So last season we met a woman named Lisa,

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.660
who wanted to cheer up some
kids in her neighborhood.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.480
So she conjured up a
fantastical world filled

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:18.248
with fairies where children
could engage and adults

00:00:18.248 --> 00:00:21.300
if you're into that kind
of thing, it was a hit.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.133
I love it.

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:24.360
It was a hit and the kids
started writing letters

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.173
to the fairies and getting responses.

00:00:26.173 --> 00:00:28.290
Let's take a look back right now.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.960
- It really began during the lockdown.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.500
I met these two little girls
one right after the other

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.680
and they were so miserable.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.650
That I decided to teach
them about the fairies.

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:43.297
And I told them that the
fairies had come back

00:00:43.297 --> 00:00:46.353
to our realm to help them
find their happy thoughts

00:00:46.353 --> 00:00:48.690
and that they should bring them cake.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:51.210
And then one of the little girls came back

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.680
to my door and knocked on the door

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.897
and asked if the fairies
lived in my garden.

00:00:54.897 --> 00:00:55.890
And I told them

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.515
that what we really needed to
do was make a space for them

00:00:58.515 --> 00:01:01.912
and we would get a door and
the fairies would come through.

00:01:01.912 --> 00:01:05.970
And Amazon came through
and so did the door.

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.220
And then the fairies magically appeared

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.749
and started writing to the children.

00:01:10.749 --> 00:01:12.233
(audience cheering)

00:01:12.233 --> 00:01:13.066
- No joke,

00:01:13.066 --> 00:01:15.469
after this show I literally
built a whole fair garden

00:01:15.469 --> 00:01:16.797
in my backyard with my children.

00:01:16.797 --> 00:01:17.790
No joke.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:18.803
We were really into it.

00:01:18.803 --> 00:01:21.512
Since then the fairies
have found a second home.

00:01:21.512 --> 00:01:24.119
Usually we do this segment
virtually, but come on

00:01:24.119 --> 00:01:25.650
I could not resist the opportunity

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.617
to meet another former guest
in real life and fairy lover.

00:01:28.617 --> 00:01:31.080
So Lisa is here to share the update,

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.822
give it up from Lisa y'all.

00:01:32.822 --> 00:01:34.640
(audience cheering)

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:36.990
- So what's the latest with the fairies?

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:40.500
- Well, I dunno if you've
ever heard of a witness tree.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.333
- [Kelly] No.

00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:44.237
- But the fairies were a
witness to the pandemic.

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:46.170
And so they're being honored

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:49.229
and they're being put into
the Library of Congress

00:01:49.229 --> 00:01:52.950
for being a witness to the
trials that people went

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:56.102
through a help and now
a historic landmark.

00:01:56.102 --> 00:01:56.935
- [Kelly] Aww.

00:01:56.935 --> 00:02:00.420
Which means that the "Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:02.790
or maybe I should call it
the "Fairy Clarkson Show".

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:03.623
- I'm into that one.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:04.456
- Yes.

00:02:04.456 --> 00:02:05.289
- I'm into that one.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.340
- Is going to be immortalized in the

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:09.732
Library of Congress as part

00:02:09.732 --> 00:02:12.300
of American history for the pandemic.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.133
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.730
That's so cool.

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:18.053
- So, but fairies still live
in your neighborhood right?

00:02:18.053 --> 00:02:19.109
- Well of course they do.

00:02:19.109 --> 00:02:21.010
- They live in mine too,
they're in our backyard.

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:24.120
- Well, they're not going
anywhere anytime soon.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:27.780
But the good news is that children

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.000
are doing much better emotionally now

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.430
than they were this time last year.

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:36.330
But what we did find out is
that when everybody went back

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.760
from virtual to being in person

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:42.315
all of their bullies
came in, in person too.

00:02:42.315 --> 00:02:45.180
So, so many kids are
coping with that right now

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.120
that that is like the top
priority for the fairies.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.980
- Yeah. Thank you so much, Lisa.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.590
Thank I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:55.903
And that's not all our season
long partner Pilot Pin,

00:02:55.903 --> 00:02:58.050
the go pin of the "Kelly
Clarkson Show" thinks

00:02:58.050 --> 00:02:59.400
what you're doing is so important.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:00.300
So in recognition

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.060
they'd like to use their G2
Gelling Pen to write you a check

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:03.930
for a thousand dollars.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.227
How's that sound?

00:03:05.227 --> 00:03:06.885
- Wow.

00:03:06.885 --> 00:03:07.718
- Yes!

00:03:07.718 --> 00:03:09.923
You can do a lot of cool stuff
for the fairies with that.

